New hint `prefer_arrows` for float editing, complementing the existing `prefer_slider` hint for integers.\r\n* Full RTL layout support.\r\n* Fix scaling issues for slider grabber.\r\n* Make sure text draw position always matches the `LineEdit` text position.\r\n* Fix unable to move the mouse after changing the value with mouse wheel up/down while grabbing the slider grabber.\r\n* Add up and down icons similar to SpinBox and allow right clicking them to set value to max/min.\r\n* Remove an extra `Control` node used as the parent of the internal `LineEdit` which is no longer needed.\r\n* Added proper theme cache properties instead of using get_theme* inside the class.\r\n* Refactor: Removed the `control_state` property (which previously controlled slider/arrow visibility and the integer-only `prefer_slider` flag). Introduced clearer, more descriptive properties, `hide_control`, `integer_prefer_slider` and `float_prefer_arrows`. Note: `ControlState` remains internally to tell if we are currently using slider or arrows for both floats and integers.\r\n* <s> Add symmetric fill support, useful for Control.rotation property. </s> Will be added in another PR following this.\r\n\r\nI have made a project to easily test EditorSpinSlider changes.\r\n\r\nNote: Updated the test project to work with the latest changes from this PR:\r\n[spin-slider-test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22585582/spin-slider-test.zip)\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godo